@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@supplierId = copiar-id-del-proveedor
@receiptId = copiar-id-de-la-recepcion-local
@bankAccountId = copiar-id-de-la-cuenta-del-get
@revision = 1
@requestKey = generar-uuid-por-pago
@paymentDate = 2026-11-23
@paymentId = copiar-id-del-pago-web
@reversalKey = generar-uuid-por-reversion
@cutId = copiar-id-del-corte-original
@reversalDate = copiar-fecha-del-preview

### Previsualizar el saldo y las cuentas autorizadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{receiptId}}

### Registrar pago parcial de un saldo de prueba
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{receiptId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{requestKey}}",
  "revision": {{revision}},
  "bankAccountId": {{bankAccountId}},
  "mode": "transfer",
  "amount": 40,
  "date": "{{paymentDate}}",
  "description": "PRUEBA DE PAGO PARCIAL"
}

### Consultar el abono en Bancos
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/payments

### Consultar si el PP puede revertirse y obtener su corte original
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/reversal

### Revertir un PP pendiente y reabrir el saldo del documento
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/reversal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{reversalKey}}",
  "date": "{{paymentDate}}",
  "reason": "Reversión de prueba",
  "confirmed": true
}

### Revertir un PP conciliado en la base de pruebas. Usar una clave propia y el corte del preview.
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/reversal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{reversalKey}}",
  "date": "{{reversalDate}}",
  "reason": "Reversión de PP conciliado en pruebas",
  "expectedReconciliationId": {{cutId}},
  "confirmed": true
}

### Consultar el cargo RP pendiente del nuevo corte
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/reconciliation
